From bb4a2fe944247e46060469baf8166784b11a0d29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 16:32:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: add doc-region markers for the book's literalinclude

Comment-only markers (// doc-region-begin/end <name>) so the Mario 64 book can
literalinclude exact spans by name instead of drift-prone line numbers. First
region: euler_zxy_to_matrix (the Euler-angle rotation matrix builder).
